<div class="">
   
    @* <p class="paraCommon" style="font-size:24px">    <b>MY LIFE JOURNEY IN COLORS</b>
      <span style="font-size:18px;display:block;margin-top:10px;">CV/Resume/Biodata/Candidate Profile → Reinvented.</span>    
      </p> *@
    <div class="bgCVLangingLower">
        @* <div style="text-align:center; padding-top:10px">
            <img src="~/images/cv_langing.jpeg" width="60%" />
        </div> *@
        <div style="text-align:center; padding-top:10px">
            <img src="~/images/cv1.png" width="50%" />
        </div>
       
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>Not Just What You Did… But Who You Became.</b></p>
        <p class="paraCommon"> A simple CV can never capture the real story of a young person. Marks, certificates, and job titles show only one slice of your life — not the environment you grew up in, the struggles you faced, the choices you made, the turns that shaped you, and the lessons that built your character.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon"> <b>"My Life Journey in Colors"</b> gives space to your full story — not just the polished achievements, but the experiences that truly shaped your identity.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">
            Because employers deserve a truthful picture. <br />
            And you deserve a fair chance to present yourself honestly and proudly.
        </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"></p>
        </div>
    <div class="bgCVLangingLower" style="padding-top:10px">
          <div style="text-align:center; padding-top:10px">
            <img src="~/images/cv2.png" width="50%" />
        </div>
        <p class="paraCommon paraHeader"  >    <b>THE PROBLEM WITH TODAY’S CVs</b> </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"> Today’s CV culture is in crisis.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">
            More than 90% of CVs contain exaggerations, omissions, or fabrications. AI tools now generate impressive-sounding resumes in minutes.
            And students from Tier 2/3/4 towns feel pressured to “sound bigger” just to keep up.
        </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">
            <b>The impact?</b>
            <ul>
                <li>•	Employers don’t trust resumes anymore.</li>
                <li>•	Honest candidates get overshadowed.</li>
                <li>•	Interviews feel like interrogation instead of discovery.</li>
                <li>•	Young people begin their careers with stress, fear… not pride.</li>
            </ul>
        </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">The CV has become a performance, not a reflection. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">This is the anomaly we want to fix. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Not by scaring or punishing candidates, but by replacing the old CV with something human, truthful, and complete — a mirror of “Your Life Journey in Colors.” </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="bgCVLangingLower" style="padding-top:10px">
          <div style="text-align:center; padding-top:10px">
            <img src="~/images/cv3.png" width="50%" />
        </div>
        <p class="paraCommon paraHeader"  >    <b>HOW WE FIX THE CV PROBLEM; TOGETHER</b> </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>1️. A 360-degree profile that captures the real person, not just the polished candidate.</b> Your family context, schooling realities, turning points, failures, re-routing, growth, and aspirations are part of your truth and truth is always powerful.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>2️	Encouraging honesty through structure, not fear.</b> Instead of forcing candidates to decorate their CV, this system guides them to express their life as it is with dignity, depth, and self-awareness. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>3️	Shifting focus from inflated claims to real potential.</b> Employers get a more accurate picture of Character, Resilience, Decision-Making, Grit, Learning ability. These matter far more than exaggerated achievements. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>4️	Reducing the entire “CV falsification crisis.”</b> Once the system changes, the behavior changes. Candidates no longer feel the need to lie — because the format itself rewards authenticity. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>5️	Making hiring fairer for Tier 2/3/4 India.</b> Your journey matters even if it didn’t come wrapped in elite English or metro privilege. This format celebrates sincerity and effort, not glamour. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>6️	Creating an emotional connection between employer and candidate.</b> It humanizes recruitment, making it about people, not paperwork.</p>
        <p class="paraCommon">We rebuild trust; helping employers connect with the person, not just the paperwork. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="bgCVLangingLower" style="padding-top:10px">
          <div style="text-align:center; padding-top:10px">
            <img src="~/images/cv1.png" width="50%" />
        </div>
        <p class="paraCommon paraHeader">    <b>BEGIN YOUR LIFE JOURNEY IN COLORS</b> </p>
        <p class="paraCommon">Come, fill in the true colors of your story with honesty, pride, and confidence. </p>
        <p class="paraCommon"><b>Your journey deserves to be told. Your colors deserve to be seen…</b> </p>
